{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376286-kickstarters-postponed-due-to-coronavirus","id":1376286,"title":"Kickstarters postponed due to Coronavirus","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-23T11:59:45-07:00","id":1376286,"title":"Kickstarters postponed due to Coronavirus","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/legendlore-rpg-setting-for-5th-edition-fantasy-roleplaying/posts/2791484\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Legendlore</b> Kickstarter ( in middle of it ) has been postponed due to Coronavirus pandemic</a>. It's coming to be relunched later this year. Are we going to see a halt on the Kickstarters queue from Onyx Path Publishing in general?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-21-2020, 09:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-23T12:08:09-07:00","id":1376288,"title":"","content":"Oh,that's not good at all. It's necessary but it sucks<br /> Let's hope other projects can continue","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-23T13:34:31-07:00","id":1376302,"title":"","content":"I can't imagine they're going to start any new Kickstarter drives right now.<br /> <br /> Too many people are looking to many weeks, if not months, without money to spare... crowdfunding is going to be tough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-23T16:00:37-07:00","id":1376323,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376286-kickstarters-postponed-due-to-coronavirus?p=1376302#post1376302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can't imagine they're going to start any new Kickstarter drives right now.<br /> <br /> Too many people are looking to many weeks, if not months, without money to spare... crowdfunding is going to be tough.</div> </div> </div> </div>you're most likely right. and i was so looking forward to technocracy reloaded and scion demigod <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-23T16:48:45-07:00","id":1376325,"title":"","content":"They might not Kickstart every book they were originally intending too. Supplements like Technocracy Reloaded might get reevaluated compared to books like Demigod. Not every book goes through Kickstarter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-24T02:47:02-07:00","id":1376385,"title":"","content":"I think its a smart move. Many would view a kickstarter in poor taste right now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-24T05:00:38-07:00","id":1376393,"title":"","content":"<b>Legendlore</b> is postponed - but <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/we-leave-the-realm-for-now-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>M20 Technocracy Reloaded</b> is being ready to Kickstarter</a>. But even then - 'readying' can take up to two months, when main surge of pandemic will pass...<br /> <br /> 'As talked about above, we have cancelled the <b>Legendlore </b>Kickstarter for the time being. We\u2019ll get <b>Legendlore</b> back on KS as soon as we can, and meanwhile we are building the <b>M20 Technocracy Reloaded</b> Kickstarter!'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-24T17:55:47-07:00","id":1376456,"title":"","content":"I'll be ready and waiting to throw all of my money at the Technocracy: Reloaded KS, whether it happens in a few weeks or a few months. Same with Ghost Hunters, though I'd prefer if it released direct to Drive Thru as it was originally intended.<br /> <br /> Legendlore doesn't exactly interest me, but I can understand why they'd want to pull the KS down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-25T08:17:04-07:00","id":1376555,"title":"","content":"If anything this whole situation highlights the unsustainable nature of the kickstart just about everything model.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-25T10:32:26-07:00","id":1376582,"title":"","content":"I don't see how that's the case.<br /> <br /> It highlights the instability of crowdfunding as a major part of your income stream, sure. But niche luxury products like RPG books are always going to be sensitive to disposable income among the audience. The global economy is in the toilet, and most countries' economies are similarly in bad shape; many still getting worse. This is bad for RPG books regardless of funding styles.<br /> <br /> If anything this shows that crowdfunding is more robust, not the other way around. Before major e-commerce, a RPG publisher could easily tank if something like this happened. If nobody's buying your books, you have no income, and you have a warehouse full of books that you're paying for on top of it. A global disaster killing sales for months means a stack of debt most RPG companies could never recover from back then. Using Kickstarter like Onyx Path does means they can pause projects in reaction to such events. There isn't a shipment of Legendlore books waiting around unsold that Onyx Path has to worry about. Money isn't being tied up in production and shipping on a book they can't sell yet.<br /> <br /> Being able to just say, &quot;Nope, we're delaying this KS because of the COVID-19 pandemic&quot; is a sign that their crowdfunding strategy is sustainable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-21T06:48:21-07:00","id":1382967,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/insert-punny-title-here-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Technocracy Reload</b> KS is announced on 28th April</a>, <b>Legendlore</b> is still only 'postponed'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-21T16:03:56-07:00","id":1383046,"title":"","content":"I think we've seen that if it's something people want, a KS can still be largely successful.--even during a pandemic. McFarlane's Spawn Remastered is going to pass 2 million, easily. And I have a good feeling Technocracy: Reloaded is going to do very well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T12:04:21-07:00","id":1384469,"title":"","content":"And...Technocracy Reloaded has funded in 45 minutes! ^^^^^^^^^^^<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-02T13:38:53-07:00","id":1393694,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/legendlore-postponed/\" target=\"_blank\">Start of Legendlore Kickstarter is postponed for two days</a>, because of <a href=\"https://twitter.com/hashtag/BlackOutTuesday?src=hashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\">#BlackOutTuesday</a> in USA and on social media - related to protests in USA, right now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}